---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../components/Sidebar.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于">
  <div class="page-with-sidebar">
    <Sidebar />
    <div class="page-main">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">关于</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">关于这个博客和我</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content card">
        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> 关于博客</h2>
          <p>欢迎来到 YuQi Blog，这是一个基于 <strong>Astro</strong> 框架构建的个人博客。</p>
          <p>这里是我记录生活、分享思考与创作的小角落。博客的名字取自"雨祁"——意为雨中的祈愿，希望在每一个雨天，都能找到内心的宁静与力量。</p>
          <p>博客采用简约的动漫风格设计，支持明暗主题切换，搭配樱花飘落特效和看板娘，致力于营造一个温馨、舒适的阅读环境。</p>
          <div class="about-tags">
            <span class="about-tag">Astro</span>
            <span class="about-tag">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="about-tag">Tailwind CSS</span>
            <span class="about-tag">Live2D</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-divider"></div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-astronaut"></i> 关于我</h2>
          <p>你好，我是<strong>雨祁</strong>，一个热爱技术与二次元的普通人。</p>
          <p>喜欢探索新技术，热衷于前端开发和创意编程；同时也是一名动漫爱好者，闲暇时会追番、玩游戏，偶尔也会画画和写写文字。</p>
          <p>相信"生命绚烂，别被黑暗压垮"，希望用自己的方式记录生活中的美好瞬间。</p>
          <div class="about-hobbies">
            <span class="hobby-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> 编程</span>
            <span class="hobby-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-tv"></i> 追番</span>
            <span class="hobby-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i> 游戏</span>
            <span class="hobby-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i> 摄影</span>
            <span class="hobby-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i> 绘画</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-divider"></div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <h2 class="about-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> 联系方式</h2>
          <p>如果你有任何问题或想要交流，欢迎通过以下方式联系我：</p>
          <div class="contact-list">
            <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="contact-item">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
              <span>{siteConfig.email}</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/qitinyu" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-item">
              <i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i>
              <span>GitHub</span>
            </a>
            <a href={siteConfig.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-item">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i>
              <span>{siteConfig.url}</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-with-sidebar {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
  }

  .page-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .page-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .page-subtitle { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .about-content {
    padding: 36px;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease both;
  }

  .about-section { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .about-heading {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .about-heading i {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-content p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .about-content p strong {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-color), transparent);
    margin: 28px 0;
  }

  .about-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .about-tag {
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--primary-alpha);
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-hobbies {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .hobby-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .hobby-item i {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .hobby-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(125, 152, 245, 0.15);
  }

  .contact-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .contact-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--primary-alpha);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .contact-item i {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    width: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-item:hover {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #fff;
    transform: translateX(6px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(125, 152, 245, 0.3);
  }

  .contact-item:hover i {
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .page-with-sidebar { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
